figure and manage remotely from an OLT</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong style=\"color: rgb(80, 82, 85); background-color: initial;\">Smooth Connection:</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(80, 82, 85); background-color: initial;\"> Supports VLAN, 802.1q, smooth network connection for IPTV and other services</span></li></ol><p><br></p>', 0, NULL, '2025-10-01 09:59:07', '2026-02-08 20:12:20', 1, 1, 'AC1200 Wireless VoIP GPON Router', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0.00, 0, NULL, NULL, 'KBI9ZC');
